  {
   "text": "The lake looked frozen solid, so Tom cut across it.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 3.313
  },
  {
   "text": "Ice can be thick in one spot and thin a step later, and you can't see the difference.",
   "start": 3.563,
   "end": 8.008
  },
  {
   "text": "The rule: on a hike, stay off frozen lakes and streams.",
   "start": 8.258,
   "end": 11.697
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this for winter.",
   "start": 12.047,
   "end": 13.24
  }
